// The metamorphosis forms: a second - or fifteenth - npc record for a pet that already exists.
// Same item, same category, same follower mechanism, a different look. See
// npc/scripts/pet_metamorph.rs2 for the ring they sit in and how the chosen one is remembered.
//
// EVERY FORM IN A RING IS A FULL MEMBER of it, including the base record over in boss_pets.npc or
// skill_pets.npc: each one carries param=metamorph_next naming the next, and the last names the
// base again. A ring rather than a list means one param does pairs and fifteens alike, and
// tools/follower_battery.py checks every ring is closed and that every form in it names the same
// pet_item_id - a form pointing at the wrong item would hand you somebody else's pet on pick-up.
//
// WHAT THEY ARE NAMED FOR is what the render shows, not their OSRS ids: the chinchompa's other
// three are plainly red, black and gold, the heron's is the Great blue heron, and the kalphite
// princess's is green and wingless where the base is orange and winged. The rift guardian's
// fourteen are the exception and are numbered: one mesh in fifteen recolours whose meanings the
// cache does not state, so naming them would be inventing.
//
// THE ONLY FORM WITH ANIMATIONS OF ITS OWN is the green kalphite princess - OSRS gives 6638 its
// own ready and walk (6239/6238, converted into pet_forms.seq), and the base's 6236 would not fit
// a mesh with no wings. Every other form shares its base's pair, which is also what keeps the
// client's walk-merge working: both animations come from the same source and share a base.
//
// size=1 on all of them, including the green kalphite princess, whose cache record says 2. A
// two-tile follower cannot path where a one-tile one can, and the whole family is size=1.
//
// The op set matches every other pet - op1 Pick-up, op3 Talk-to - plus op4 Metamorphosis. OSRS
// puts Metamorphosis on op3 and Pick-up on op4, but the op NUMBERS here belong to the category
// (the four triggers in npc/scripts/boss_pets.rs2 serve every pet), so one pet cannot reorder
// them without reordering all of them.

[bosspet_kalphite_queen_green]
// OSRS npc 6638
name=Kalphite princess
desc=Green, and no wings. The other side of the Kalphite Queen.
model1=npc_bosspet_kalphite_queen_green_1
model2=npc_bosspet_kalphite_queen_green_2
head1=npc_bosspet_kalphite_queen_green_head1
readyanim=osrs_seq_6239
walkanim=osrs_seq_6238
resizeh=45
resizev=45
size=1
vislevel=hide
timer=20
op1=Pick-up
op3=Talk-to
op4=Metamorphosis
category=bosspet
param=pet_item_id,bosspet_kalphite_queen_item
param=metamorph_next,bosspet_kalphite_queen

